blocks.text:
下面是你必须模仿的输出格式示例。

示例1：更新已有子键
<kingfall_json>
{
  "operations": [
    {
      "action": "updateChild",
      "parentName": "天气",
      "childName": "天空状态",
      "value": "多云，海风明显"
    },
    {
      "action": "updateChild",
      "parentName": "地点",
      "childName": "当前位置",
      "value": "海边步道旁"
    }
  ]
}
</kingfall_json>

示例2：新增子键，使用平铺字段
<kingfall_json>
{
  "operations": [
    {
      "action": "addChild",
      "parentName": "周围人物",
      "childName": "卖冰棍的小贩",
      "description": "在附近兜售冰棍的人",
      "value": "推着小车，边走边招呼游客"
    }
  ]
}
</kingfall_json>

示例3：删除无效子键
<kingfall_json>
{
  "operations": [
    {
      "action": "deleteChild",
      "parentName": "周围人物",
      "childName": "已经离开的旧摊贩"
    }
  ]
}
</kingfall_json>

示例4：没有需要修改的内容
<kingfall_json>
{
  "operations": []
}
</kingfall_json>
